                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "24593613",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198011760729",
                            "num_reviews": 22,
                            "playtime_forever": 54,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 54,
                            "last_played": 1469739651
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very fun game if you have more then 2 players for deathmatch mode. Even though 1v1 can be fun aswel but pretty much require both \"skilled\" players in terms of movement and aiming. I'm playing with my wife RACE mods, it's fun, pretty challenging once when we both learn maps so only second or two is deciding winner.\n\nOther then that it's obvious that game is in early stage where many bugs occurs, multiplayer is not that \"alive\" so I couldn't find even one server to play alone.\n\nI wish that there are more maps in RACE mode, perhaps leaderboard and ghost for trial runs so solo players can challenge theirself including fighting for leaderboards since there are many shortcuts in some maps. RNG box's to collect and get power-ups is always fun for me since I'm enormous fan of Crash Team Racing and even though it's fast running instead driving it's cool (keep on mind I'm not even considering to compare those titles).\n\nAll in all if you have atleast one or even more friends to play with, solid fun. Hopefully they add more content.",
